  "description": "What Oathkeeper IS (Pebbles' chat UI that sits ON TOP of a harness — Claude Code / Codex / OpenCode — and wires FULL context to the AI), the CONTEXT vs NO-CONTEXT switch (work on a permanent pebble + its whole graph, vs. a scratch session that must not touch permanent spec), the temporary session tabs, everything it relays (refs, sub-refs, resources, agent/skill wiring, attachments, intent, tabs), permission enforcement, and the run lifecycle. Not a pebble type — the layer that carries all the others to the AI.",
